{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12204460","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12204460","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1220446001:0":{"text":"스탠턴 씨, 잘 부탁합니다.","source_cn":"斯坦顿先生，合作愉快。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x760CC65D7AF4E3A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1220446002:0":{"text":"정말 믿기지가 않네요... 제, 제가 프로 복싱 선수가 되다뇨!","source_cn":"简直不敢相信……我、我成为职业拳手了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x64ABC341B4A6A9C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1220446003:0":{"text":"감사합니다... 저... 정말 무슨 말을 해야 할지 모르겠네요. 하지만 여러분께 정말 너무 감사합니다.","source_cn":"谢谢……我……我不知道该说什么好，但真的很感谢你们的帮助。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x54C819D08C3F094A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1220446004:0":{"text":"루카 님, 그때 말씀하신 조건. 이제 그게 뭔지 말씀해 주실 수 있을까요?","source_cn":"卢卡先生，你说过要我答应你一个条件，现在可以告诉我是什...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x01B22D1EFD6174F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1220446005:0":{"text":"당시 소니아는 나를 구해주었고, 나는 그녀의 안목이 틀리지 않았다는 걸 스스로 증명해 보였어.","source_cn":"索尼娅当年救了我，我已经证明了自己，证明了她的眼光没错。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x07EF45CF9038E19F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1220446006:0":{"text":"너는 챔피언 벨트로 내 안목이 틀리지 않았다는 걸 증명해 주었으면 해. 알겠나?","source_cn":"而你，你要拿着冠军的金腰带来见我，证明我的眼光也没错。...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E4DA32471095B29","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1220446007:0":{"text":"알겠습니다, 루카 님! 반드시 그렇게 할 겁니다... 반드시!","source_cn":"我记住了，卢卡先生！我会做到的……我一定会！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF05416692297116A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1220446008:0":{"text":"좋아, 이제 가서 네가 해야 하는 일을 하도록 해. 네가 스스로를 증명해 보이는 그날까지 기다리지.","source_cn":"好了，小子，做你该做的事情去吧，我等着你证明自己的那天。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x19D489EF7AF5F1E8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:拳击掮客希尔森":{"text":"권투 선수 브로커 힐슨","source":"拳击掮客希尔森","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:地下拳手斯坦顿":{"text":"권투 선수 스탠턴","source":"地下拳手斯坦顿","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:卢卡":{"text":"루카","source":"卢卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":3}}